config TEGRA_DCE_GUEST_PROXY
	bool "Tegra DCE guest proxy support"
	help
	  Redirects the guest DCE driver's client IPC through a shared MMIO
	  window to a QEMU bridge, which relays it to the real, host-owned DCE.

	  Say Y here to enable this driver and to compile this driver as a
	  module, choose M here. If unsure, say N
